## Prettier 格式化配置

即使使用 ESLint，格式化通常交给 **Prettier**：

```json
{
  "semi": true,
  "singleQuote": true,
  "trailingComma": "all",
  "printWidth": 100,
  "tabWidth": 2,
  "arrowParens": "always",
  "endOfLine": "lf"
}
```

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "format": "prettier --write \"**/*.{ts,tsx,json,md,yml}\"",
    "format:check": "prettier --check \"**/*.{ts,tsx,json,md,yml}\""
  }
}
```

